      <h1>DAIRY QUEEN SECRET MENU: 15 TESTED PREP-STATION RECIPES &amp; SAVORY HACKS</h1>
      <p style="margin-top:10px;opacity:.85;font-size:.95rem;">By The Queen Dairy Menu Food Research Desk · Tested Across Grill &amp; Chill Locations · Updated September 2026</p>
